Subject: [PATCH 7/8] inkling2: build glue: zig build steps for the family, its
 kernels and tools

8 files (1 new, 7 changed upstream files), on TensorFold 223da7659b2f1ec7a6fe666cb064d839382d6fce.
Part of the engine changes behind Inkling-2-Small TP4 v0.1 (github.com/swbiggart/inkling2-sparks).
Apply the whole series in order with git am (scripts/build-engine.sh does); only the full series is built and gated.
